{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:8c3a0718b686e7d0","name":"Biotech Surgery","source":{"id":"source:reference-8c3a0718b686e7d0","title":"Biotech Surgery","revision":16233,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:32Z","sha256":"10c5ef46eb7d82df206e70ccc596c1c556688563527c22df6cbb426fe053cbc7","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16233","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Biotech%20Surgery&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-8c3a0718b686e7d0","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can perform the surgical procedures necessary to graft ",{"tag":"a","children":["Biotech"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Biotech"}," components onto living flesh, similar to those used by the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," You can install ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bio-Implants"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bio-Implants"}," onto a living being. The surgical procedure takes 1 hour of uninterrupted work, after which you must make a DC 20 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," check. If the check succeeds, the prosthesis is installed correctly. If the check fails, the prosthesis is not installed properly; however, you can try again after another uninterrupted hour of surgery.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," You can install ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bio-Implants"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bio-Implants"}," on yourself, but you take a -5 penalty on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," check. If you have the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surgical Expertise"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surgical_Expertise","referenceId":"reference:395f2bbe479502d2"}," feat, you can install a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bio-Implant"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bio-Implant"}," in 10 minutes instead of 1 hour.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
